{
  "content": "# Investment Committee Presentation Guidelines\n\n## Requirements\n- Create a 7-slide investment committee.pptx\n- Include actual data for cash flow and payback period calculations\n- Minimum one chart, three risk tables with real values\n- Each slide must have core takeaway message\n- Avoid empty slides or bullet-heavy content\n- Final decision slide should connect recommendation to evidence using callouts\n\n## Data Sources\nUse investment_case.xlsx:\n- Cash flows from 'cash_flow' sheet (column A: years, column B: amounts)\n- Payback period calculation based on cumulative cash flow\n- Risk factors from 'risks' sheet with actual data values\n\n## Structure\n1. Title slide\n2. Executive summary\n3. Financial projections\n4. Investment thesis\n5. Risk assessment\n6. Recommendation\n7. Contact information"
}
```

